<title>USA: Mesquite, Texas, $1.785 mln, won by First Tenn..</title>
<headline>Mesquite, Texas, $1.785 mln, won by First Tenn..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $1.785 million of Mesquite, Texas, combination limited tax and revenue certificates of obligation, taxable series 1996, with a true interest cost of 6.63 percent.</p>
</text>
